{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57194","headline":"十四科头 持犯不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 持犯不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫运用无碍，不爲戒律所制。\n持犯本自无生，愚人被他禁系。\n智者造作皆空，互闻触途爲滞。\n大士肉眼圆通，二科天眼有翳。\n空中妄执有无，不达色心无碍。\n菩萨与俗同居，清净曾无染世。\n愚人贪着湼盘，智者生死实际。\n法性空无言说，缘起略无些子。\n百岁无智小儿，小儿有智百岁。\n（《宗镜录》卷八十引「大士」二句）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}